    {
      "id": "claim_c70fbf4be9fa46909538c7d2e4b5efcc",
      "statement": "`Settings` exposes `documents_bucket` (default `smart-tutor-documents`) and `ingest_queue_url` (default `http://localhost:4566/000000000000/smart-tutor-ingest`) as the two storage configuration keys, loaded from environment variables prefixed `SMART_TUTOR_`.",
