      "id": "claim_b85d3d000fef436798c2ecdba3fba43f",
      "statement": "Docling JSON, PostgreSQL chunks, and summary embeddings are never moved to Glacier, so the research map, topic catalog, knowledge graph, and chunk-text re-embedding work without a Glacier restore; only a full re-extraction (e.g. a Docling version upgrade) requires retrieving the archived PDF.",
