      "statement": "In local development, a LocalStack service (image `localstack/localstack:4`) emulates S3, SQS, SSM, and Secrets Manager on port 4566; the init script `local/localstack/init/ready.d/10-smart-tutor.sh` creates the bucket (with versioning), the `smart-tutor-ingest` and `smart-tutor-ingest-dlq` SQS queues, the S3→SQS bucket notification for the `uploads/` prefix, CORS for `http://localhost:5173`, and the `/smart-tutor/learning-record-idle-minutes` SSM parameter.",
